'Aggregate ERA=9ΣER/ΣIP, WHIP=(ΣH+ΣBB)/ΣIP, AVG=ΣH/ΣAB, OBP=(ΣH+ΣBB+ΣHBP)/(ΣAB+ΣBB+ΣHBP+ΣSF) and SLG=ΣTB/ΣAB. Aggregate OPS sums aggregate OBP and SLG. `Aggregate_Ratios.csv` supplies these quantities; individual ratios are never averaged. Actual QA3 remains 5+ IP with <=2 ER OR 6+ IP with <=3 ER.\n',
